    "expires_at": "2026-04-28T20:10:00Z",
    "opened_at": "2026-04-28T20:01:00Z",
    "approved_at": "2026-04-28T20:02:30Z"
  }
}

### Regras

- deve validar ownership da request;
- deve retornar status da proof_request e proof_session;
- não deve retornar session_token_hash;
